<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:28:05 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>乌克兰是否使用母舰对班加西的俄罗斯船只发动海上无人机攻击？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi</link><description>&lt;p&gt;秘密母舰将使乌克兰有能力扩大对远离黑海的俄罗斯航运的攻击。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi"&gt;乌克兰是否使用母舰对班加西的俄罗斯船只发动海上无人机攻击？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:12:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi</guid></item><item><title>海军陆战队希望射程加倍的海军打击导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range</link><description>&lt;p&gt;增程 NSM 巡航导弹将使海军陆战队能够在四倍的区域内将战舰和地面目标置于危险之中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; The post &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range"&gt;Marines Want Naval Strike Missiles With Double The Range&lt;/a&gt; appeared first on &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt; .&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:45:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range</guid></item><item><title>中国海军发展成为珠海航展的焦点</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow</link><description>&lt;p&gt;即将举行的展览将突出北京对舰载航空、主要水面作战舰艇和新兴无人系统的雄心。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow"&gt;珠海航展上中国海军发展成为焦点的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:30:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰针对远离黑海的俄罗斯海军资产的行动进入新阶段（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌克兰在一天内成功摧毁了一艘新的俄罗斯护卫舰，并击中了另外两艘货船，一艘在地中海，一艘在波罗的海。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase"&gt;乌克兰针对远在黑海之外的俄罗斯海军资产的行动进入新阶段（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:26:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase</guid></item><item><title>西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，接替乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</link><description>&lt;p&gt;截至 2026 年 11 月 21 日，航空母舰所在位置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington"&gt;西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，救援乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰&lt;/a&gt;后，首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:11:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</guid></item><item><title>地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我嘴里有股奇怪的黄铜味，你尝到了吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216"&gt;《地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:12:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</guid></item><item><title>空军一号从中国出发的长途飞行不仅仅是打破记录</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records</link><description>&lt;p&gt;VC-25B 桥式喷气式飞机提高了空军一号执行空运任务时在高空停留时间的标准，但波音公司的新型 VC-25B 喷气式飞机可能无法做到这一点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records"&gt;空军一号从中国出发的长途飞行不仅仅是打破记录，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:39:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records</guid></item><item><title>奇怪的CFL-120卡帕特中型坦克配备大炮面对装甲日益敌视的战场</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor</link><description>&lt;p&gt;该车辆配备 120 毫米火炮和 35 吨履带式底盘，随着无人机的出现，任何重量的装甲车都变得越来越复杂。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor"&gt;配备大炮的奇怪 CFL-120 卡帕特中型坦克面对装甲日益敌视的战场，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:26:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor</guid></item><item><title>海军 CCA 计划不会等待 F/A-XX 下一代战斗机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter</link><description>&lt;p&gt;海军的协同作战飞机愿景正在巩固，F-35 可以充当这些无人机的第一批空中“四分卫”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后 &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter"&gt;海军 CCA 计划不会等待 F/A-XX 下一代战斗机&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:38:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter</guid></item><item><title>神秘的MQ-25类似黄貂鱼的中国无人机出现在鲜为人知的飞行测试中心</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在中国一处不起眼的飞行测试设施中拍摄到的不明无人机的卫星图像引发了有趣的问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center"&gt;神秘的 MQ-25 类似黄貂鱼的中国无人机在鲜为人知的飞行测试中心出现，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:16:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center</guid></item></channel></rss>